{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_st_14-01","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"st_14-01","title":"從回憶中墜落","storyCode":"14-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_14-01.txt","sourceHash":"0ea7c962644cf1497399c0b879c36622c18b12b89370295ef27a2bbf3902ccfa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐，您回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了，還不去睡覺呀，要是被凱爾希發現，她可要生氣囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是……有點睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我陪陪你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒關係的，特蕾西婭小姐！您要是還有別的工作，那我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是等了我一天了？出了什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！我……大家都對我很好，功課也很順利，凱爾希醫生出的作業我也都寫完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道特蕾西婭小姐您最近很忙，我不該總纏著您，可不知道為什麼，我今天就是……特別想見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，阿米婭，來我這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭俯下身去，輕輕抱了抱阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你見到我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我之前有一次看見大家都走了，您卻還站在這裡，一個人待了好久好久——我還記得您那時的表情，我不明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在擔心什麼嗎？哥哥姐姐們不是都說，我們快贏了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，總有好消息傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的戰士又攻克了一座小鎮，又拿下了一片陣地……卡茲戴爾，我們的家，又一次近在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，巴別塔還有很遠的路要走。遠到……我甚至不知道我們是否還在朝著原來的目標航行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭輕輕嘆了一口氣，視線飄向遠方，阿米婭順著特蕾西婭的目光看去，那裡明明什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，巴別塔從來不是為了“勝利”而存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利與傷痕相伴相生，而撫平這些傷口……卻比我們所預想的要艱難得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或者說，它們真的能被撫平嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭的聲音很輕，輕到像是一場溶化在水裡的夢，霧氣升騰上來，片刻的笑意變得遙遠而模糊不清。\n小小的卡特斯女孩覺得，在一兩個瞬間，那個一直牽著她手的人，似乎也一同消失在了濃霧裡。\n於是，阿米婭努力踮起腳尖，伸出手去。孩子柔軟的指腹觸向魔王的眉間，想揉開那些輕輕皺起的溝壑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可以的，一定可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐，您以前和我說的話，我都一直記著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“有一天，我們會一起讓這片大地上的每一個人，都能平靜入夢。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊，其中有你，也有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，阿米婭，將來的事我們可以將來再說，但要是你今天還熬夜，就真的要長不高了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到很久以後，羅德島威風凜凜地開過各種地方，可你還是個小不點，那該怎麼辦呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是……把耳朵豎起來，是不是就能顯得更高了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，呵呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呀，是不是就是不想回房間？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我沒有不聽話！但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我們就不告訴凱爾希，再待一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我都好久沒跟你講故事了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，您以前講過的那些，我還都記得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“很久以前，有一片很大很大的沙漠，還有一個由碎布縫成的小娃娃，小布人立誓要穿越沙漠，找到傳說中那片希望的平原……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，您還從來沒有講到這個故事的結尾呢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個故事啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙漠裡面有很多嚇人的東西，阿米婭聽了就真的要睡不著覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕，而且，既然是特蕾西婭小姐講的故事，就一定會有個甜甜的結尾吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙漠啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片沙漠是那麼大，就好像真的沒有盡頭一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的小布人經歷了那麼多的冒險，他終於來到了這裡。他的目標就在眼前了，“希望的平原”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片平原會是什麼樣子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那是個……不管什麼人，都願意稱之為“家”的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就有吃不完的紅蘿蔔派，還有船上的哥哥姊姊也都在一起了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，故事總是沒有那麼簡單。他還得克服最後的困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片沙漠夜裡冷極了，風也總是不停。雙月的光輝下，好像有些黑袍的影子在竊竊私語，可要是去找，他們卻又一下子消失不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些黑袍的影子是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是最古老最古老的，絕望和悲哀的迴響。一旦被他們抓住，就再也逃不開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了阻止小布人，影子們竊竊私語著，布置了一個又一個陷阱……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些黑袍的影子不願意小布人繼續前進，他們使盡了渾身解數，希望小布人能夠掉頭返回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，要是小布人穿越了沙漠，希望就會漫延開來，而他們也將消失不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但小布人不知道這些，小布人的目標從未改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人繞過了陷阱，逃開了陰謀，影子們所有的算計都落空了。他們氣得哇哇大叫，決定不再躲藏，和小布人決一死戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著蜂擁而來的影子們，小布人抽出了針和線做的長矛，與他們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐，他們為什麼會變成絕望與悲哀的回聲呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也感染了礦石病，會痛到晚上睡不著覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，小布人能不能治好他們？就像您和凱爾希醫生想要做的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……治好他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要小布人治好了他們，讓他們變成……唔，快樂又平靜的影子，大家就可以一起去希望的平原了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是他們天生就很壞，喜歡嚇唬別人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，不是的。當然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人發現……原來他們的身上都有傷口，是這些傷口讓他們變成了現在的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人能不能用針線幫他們縫好？就像您一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許……可以試試看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呵欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，沒有！小布人成功了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人試了又試，針腳又粗又醜，把黑袍影子們惹得跳腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然、然後呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許……快樂與平靜也許沒有那麼容易得來，但他們最終還是決定放小布人離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑袍的影子們目送著小布人遠去，他們決定讓小布人去試試。可是……一條大河攔在了小布人的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人甚至不知道那條河到底有多寬，只知道根本看不到對岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人明白，希望的平原一定就在對面，可是附近沒有船，連一片樹葉都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這下怎麼辦？小布人想了又想，決定試試看能不能游過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……他是個……小布人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他是個小布人，沾了水就會越來越重，直到沉進河裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是停在這裡的話，這一路的冒險就成了一場空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人還是跳下了水，他發現這條河流涼涼的、鹹鹹的，就像眼淚一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來，這片大地還有許多許多人都曾想去往希望的平原，只是，他們最後都失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的眼淚匯成了這一條河流，小布人明白了，曾經為此哭泣的人有這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小布人游啊游，游啊游，他覺得自己的身體漸漸被淚水浸滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼岸真的存在嗎？也許影子們說的是對的，那個地方之所以被叫作“希望的平原”，是因為沒有誰能真的到達那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們的語言並不相同，人們的心也不相通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家園，“家園”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然是河流，就一定有歸處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！博士，你什麼時候來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是大家都在等我嗎？不好意思，我馬上就……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"之前的戰鬥辛苦你了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"之前的戰鬥做得很好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的博士，我已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起過去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出發的準備已經做得差不多了，我們得全部離開布倫特伍德。好在這條骨頭確實夠大，能裝得下我們所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會一定已經知道我們控制了這個小鎮和“生命脊椎”的消息，這具骸骨的重要性不言而喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的反攻部隊恐怕已經在路上了，也許就在此刻，薩卡茲也在盯著我們的一舉一動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從他們的快速機動部隊——巫靈升上天空……霧氣裡就始終像是有眼睛盯著我們，讓人很不舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的戰鬥會越來越危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都清楚。典範軍不會放棄反攻倫蒂尼姆，我們沒有別的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人已經忍耐太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好我們拿下了這具骸骨，最理想的情況下，它能暫時充當我們的據點，傷員與平民也能姑且在這裡得到安置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，按照那位赫德雷先生的說法，它還能到處“傳送”。雖然可能會讓人有點頭昏眼花的副作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實是不可多得的助力。但我在想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……軍事委員會為何沒有殊死一搏來保衛這最重要的運輸載具？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是正面戰場的壓力迫使他們放棄，又或是因為血魔大君杜卡雷的輕敵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但可能性更大的，是他們在倫蒂尼姆城內的計劃已經到達了某個……無暇顧及外界的階段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君最後的儀式依然完成了，或許正是這一點，使他們的目光不再圍繞“生命脊椎”，而是投向了別處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生已經與骸骨殘留的意識完成了交涉，它會，嗯……“聽從我們的建議”。借助它，我們可以隨時返回戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，它給了我們接近飛空艇和碎片大廈的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們能更好地利用這張牌……也許，我們可以直接用空降的方式向倫蒂尼姆內部發動突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接端掉他們的指揮部，不錯，我喜歡這個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎片大廈的外圍防守十分森嚴，我想，軍事委員會的飛空艇也不會放任我們停留在他們頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能尋找突襲的入口，突襲小隊抵達後，讓“生命脊椎”盡快離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那意味著突襲小隊退無可退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但同時，我們也得弄清楚阿米婭始終擔憂的事情——薩卡茲究竟在籌備些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，怎麼才能把他們的小伎倆砸成碎屑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只靠我們沒那麼容易在短時間內攻下碎片大廈，但是……那座巨大的城市內還有一些我們的盟友，我們要與他們取得聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據情報推測，留守在碎片大廈裡的戰鬥人員應該不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照我和那位指揮官交手的經驗，如果特雷西斯……阿米婭小姐，我們有幾成勝算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們應該盡量避免和他正面對抗。沒有人能說自己可以輕易戰勝特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，此刻最大的威脅並不是任何一位強大的薩卡茲英雄，而是他們密謀實現的願景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制止那個願景的實現，才能盡快結束戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅靠幾支小隊無法結束戰爭，維多利亞的軍隊依然不可或缺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫德米爾公爵突然戰死前線，這一點實在超過了太多人的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……戴菲恩小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在這裡旁聽的是一位為溫德米爾公爵服務的情報人員，而不是她的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必顧慮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫德米爾公爵的離世導致倫蒂尼姆周圍原本勉強保持的平衡被打破，大戰一觸即發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，直到幾個星期之前我還在以為，公爵們只要下定決心，一同進攻倫蒂尼姆，那麼薩卡茲必敗無疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這會是一場死戰，超越所有大人物所預料的死戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我很想說，這是他們自找的，但現在在受難的，是前線的士兵和無辜的市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時……勝利的是我們，是典範軍，還是公爵們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我是不是不該在行動前說這種話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，我知道你們在擔心什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，沒有必要。無論是主動或被迫，在這場浩劫中站起身來、抬起頭來，從一個美好的大夢裡驚醒的人，絕不在少數……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也遠不止在場的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只要把目光放在當下：如何穿越戰場反攻倫蒂尼姆，如何制止碎片大廈的砲擊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不會這麼簡單。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"薩卡茲們的下一步計畫可能與源石有關。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們很可能會利用薩卡茲對於源石的古老研究。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"時間不多，我們需要快速確認行軍路線。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"直面戰場是我們唯一的選擇。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據先前的通訊，數支羅德島的支援小隊也已經在路上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面對當下的情況，有許多事，只有以羅德島的身分才能做得到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我會指揮他們的行動。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我會確保戰術的執行。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"直到此次危機徹底解除。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來各位都沒有意見了，那麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人看向了阿米婭。\n你突然有些慶幸，有些欣慰，有些亢奮和自豪。\n因為你正站在阿米婭身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這場戰爭已經陷入膠著，而特雷西斯正試圖用某種更徹底的、強硬的手段，將維多利亞撕成碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和薩卡茲是否擁有復仇的正當性無關，這和貴族們是否承擔起維多利亞的重擔也無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果任何問題都是靠將對方毀滅得一乾二淨來解決，這片本來就紛爭不斷的土地根本不配談論將來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪師和特雷西斯就在那裡，在倫蒂尼姆的心臟上，敲打這個搖搖欲墜的帝國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去，找到他們，攔住他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了那個“未來”，為了所有人的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼大的空隙，是不是很浪費？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從可露希爾那弄來了最強的炸藥，夠塞滿這裡的每個角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，他們還在打什麼“突襲倫蒂尼姆”之類的蠢主意。那可是軍事委員會，誰知道特雷西斯還有什麼後招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接轟炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你猜軍事委員會為什麼要費盡心思把這具骸骨藏起來，而不是直接把它當成第二艘飛空艇用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這東西脆得很。基本靠巫術裝置才能和巨獸殘留的生命氣息建立聯繫，稍微遭受些襲擊就可能原地報廢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說要拿它投炸彈了？我說的是，拿它當炸彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個可以自己到處亂飛的炸彈，隨時出現在特雷西斯臉上，完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，還想著用它帶我們回卡茲戴爾？不解決掉特雷西斯，我們哪裡也去不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們用最直接的方法來解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒意見，只是，我沒想到竟然能看到你緊張的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我教你深呼吸的訣竅嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，W。行動之前做好心理建設。再多炸藥也解決不了你的心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那只能說明量不夠大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說是就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些天，我們遇到巫妖的那一次……不，算了，忘了吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又在想那位特蕾西婭的真假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，把你的小玩具拿開，你要說服的人不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初自顧自說那是冒牌貨的人也不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……我說過，你的法術可真噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還用讀你的影子？你都心神不寧多久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是再看到她，你打算怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，那是假的。殺了就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就把她救下來，問個清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你不是很知道。你還沒想好要怎麼對待特蕾西婭，對待一個……“敵方領袖”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是大忌諱，你比我懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*薩卡茲粗口*，我只是有點不爽，你知道我最火大的是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得那麼多事，我記得第一個教我做炸藥的老頭腦袋上的結晶，我記得懸賞你倆的價格……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得殿下和那扇門較勁，那扇門有次還夾住了凱爾希的頭髮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得那麼多他媽的根本無關緊要的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我記不起來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我死活都想不起來我最後一次遇見殿下是在哪裡，我們在那個時候……又說了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然當然，我和殿下聊不了幾句正經話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時船上那麼多人，我是個小兵，但殿下卻是巴別塔的議長。恐怕不過是幾個玩笑，幾句輕飄飄的抱怨和嘮叨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但肯定不是……“再見”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，我只是去補上那句話。這樣我就不會忘記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，讓我手底下的雇傭兵檢查檢查軍備情況吧，準備幹一票大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果你發現自己走不動路了，需要有人踹你一腳，記得跟我說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噩夢做得夠久了，我們應該向前看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g7_airshipdock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備都已完成，飛空艇隨時可以啟航。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快要結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，再陪我走走吧，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾軍事委員會在倫蒂尼姆數個區塊的支持層中秘密修建了這樣的飛空艇船塢，這一處是最大的一個，也是飛空艇最終誕生的地方。\n這艘船被視作恐怖的戰爭兵器，毀滅的使者，飛在空中的要塞。\n但很少人知道，飛空艇建設的初衷，是要探索一個湮沒的秘密……\n更是要掙脫一副永恆的枷鎖。\n兄妹二人行走在偌大的船塢之中，走過漫長的步道，每個路過的薩卡茲都停下腳步，向他們致意。\n上次這樣肩並肩地散步是什麼時候？細細想來，間隔的天數比起他們曾經一起跨越的時間算得上短暫。\n但也夠漫長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什麼，特蕾西婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然想起，卡茲戴爾改建成移動城市的時候，我們也是像這樣並肩站在城牆上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本該是個所有人都很開心的日子，卻下起了雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人說那不是好兆頭，但我記得很清楚，魂靈熔爐的爐火，在雨幕中反而很明亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實不只這些，我突然想起了許多，許多……已經太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……從卡茲戴爾到卡茲戴爾，我們的終點近在眼前。我們的計劃，只剩下最後一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後人會看見一座偉大的城市屹立於大地，薩卡茲會如我們所願，掌握自己的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些曾經堅信你的道路的戰士，那位被稱作“魔王”的孩子，如今都走到了你的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們當然會來，我一直如此深信。他們當然會來，我一直如此深信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你決定好如何面對他們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未有過迷茫，只是……我曾經希望這一天晚點到來。不過事到如今，我反而覺得……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我低估了我本該深信的人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，我很欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很欣慰在我們做出了眼下的選擇後，他們仍然站起來對抗我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們堅韌，強大，成長的速度匪夷所思。也許最終，也會抵達你的座前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，現在的他們，也許已經比那個什麼都沒來得及完成的我……要強大許多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……拭目以待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……我也該動身了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭登上飛空艇的舷梯，特雷西斯站在原地，靜靜地看著她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我們應該有一個正式的告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭伸出手，撫平了特雷西斯披肩上的褶皺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……（古老的薩卡茲語）再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（古老的薩卡茲語）再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到艙門關閉，直到鋼鐵厚重的陰影籠罩了他們。\n兩人都未再開口言語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"來自眾魂的悸動從不停歇，特蕾西婭微微閉上眼睛，忍受著它們的翻湧。\n無盡的呢喃如同潮水，讓人困頓，讓人沉淪，讓人窒息。\n或許其中也曾有過片刻的歡愉，偶爾的盡興……但苦痛實在太多太多，以至於浸透了每一句言語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾魂啊……我依然看不見彼岸。即便，我幾乎用盡了全部力氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上，處處皆是破碎的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就算供我驅使的只有哀悼，哪怕如今是眼淚構成了我的身體……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做我的棹槳吧，做我的舟筏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用淚水承載淚水，用苦難托起苦難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也該……啟航了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos正端詳著自己手中的骨哨。他熟悉其上的每一處雕花，每一處磨損。\n他還記得，在年幼之時，自己從母親手中接過了這支骨哨，那時它的音色也不似如今這樣高亢而多彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，這就是女妖的骨哨。我還沒見過實體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖在雇傭兵之間本來就不多見，更何況是擁有骨哨的女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我聽過不少有關骨哨的故事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是恐怖的象徵，它的聲音意味著死亡的追逐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖們通報死亡，甘願成為死亡與危險的化身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很少見你使用骨哨，無論當年在巴別塔，還是現在在羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個血魔……曾指責你拒絕斥血脈中的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它早已響過，它不必再響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經擁有這麼多關於死亡的隱喻，連篇累牘，滿山滿谷──但死亡之後又是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女妖們通報死亡，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但倘若死亡並非是萬事萬物的終結，喪鐘之後並非只有虛無，那這種通報便也缺乏了意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們放下了骨哨，拿起了骨筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的意義即由筆尖誕生。而舊的過往……也只在筆尖留存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，正因如此，我們如今一起站在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，向著死亡的另一面，向著新生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論特雷西斯正準備做什麼，這場戰爭不會，也不能再次發展為歷史上已經重演過無數次的，毀滅薩卡茲的烈火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經釀成的仇恨不會輕易熄滅，但我們能阻止它淪為燒毀這片大地上一切生靈的惡火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中，包含了每一個種族。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，抓緊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的戰鬥……開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨獸的骨骼擺動身軀，再次潛入了歷史中。\n時光的碎片如同渾濁溪流中的水底氣泡，無聲破碎之後，留下的卻依然是曖昧和模糊。\n阿米婭正感受著身邊洶湧而過的時空漣漪，你看向她，她的睫毛微微顫動著，她看到了什麼？\n也許只是些浮光掠影，也許只是些轉瞬即逝的幻覺。\n回憶與歷史的距離，總比我們以為的遙遠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i25"},{"type":"narration","text":"萬千景色在巨獸的身下掠過。古老的，當代的。\n身處其間的人往往會感嘆於時代的進步或是後退，眼前的災難，手中的幸福……\n但從高處望去，也許，這些景色其實從未改變過。\n然後，幻境卻變得愈發怪異而扭曲——\n一顆種子正貪婪地吸取著養分，它翻騰著，嗚咽著，想要扯下一切虛妄的表象。\n遠超人類所理解的創造物安靜等待，只是輕輕的一次胎動，就讓大地破碎，結晶蔓生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不太對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是巨獸的能力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天空……整片天空變成了紅色！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“生命脊椎”正在失控，它被扯出了預定的航道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們遭到襲擊了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"做好迎敵準備！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"注意損害管制！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把守住所有艙室的入口，小心飛行器的突襲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反跳幫戰術已經在布置了。非戰鬥人員往避難艙室疏散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵們，全部散出去，別讓什麼噁心的小東西混上船！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡受損有報告了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在檢查——但是——不太對！怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我布置的所有監測器都顯示一切正常，這個骷髏架子沒一點破損！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"觀察哨的聯絡來了，他們沒有發現任何敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們正在墜落！我沒辦法控制它了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底*薩卡茲粗口*怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這骨頭架子不是你的好朋友嗎，赫德雷！給我穩住它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷先生，還能不能調整航向？我們不能就這樣落在戰場的中央！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在嘗試！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都把自己綁好，起碼別讓自己從骨頭縫裡被甩出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經把所有無人機都派出去了，它們會盡量牽引住巨獸脊椎，減輕一部分我們落地的衝擊力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但別抱太大希望！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下落的趨勢沒有減緩，以現在的速度……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很快，我們就會撞進地裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“言語之義，應賦予我們羽翼。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我令詞彙，托舉重量。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起效果了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖你繼續念咒，赫德雷，讓我們的方向繼續向北偏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有個峽谷，應該能裝得下我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經在做了，但我和巨獸的聯繫還在消退，能下的指令已經不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護好博士，準備抵禦衝擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的鳴叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有點不太舒服。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"它的爪子好像鉤到我了！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜下來，博士，你不會有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你那邊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷者和平民已經安置完畢，費斯特和洛洛正在固定那幾輛載具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到，伊內絲，我手底下的那些雇傭兵怎麼說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我和他們在一起，正在準備巫術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":true,"text":"還需要一點時間，大概能再抵禦一半的衝擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":true,"text":"告訴赫德雷，骨頭不會碎在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目視已經能看到峽谷，角度還不夠，需要繼續向左偏二十度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的調整機會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十度確認無誤！沒問題了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全員！做好抗衝擊準備，護住頭頸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的就看運氣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大約十秒鐘後觸地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五，四，三——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
